      "title": "Subnets and IPs",
      "items": [
        "Place subnets in at least two Availability Zones, pairing a public and a private subnet per AZ",
        "You need pods-per-node × node count IPs, counting ENI secondary IPs",
        "By scale: /24 for small, /20 for medium, /16 for large"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "DNS settings",
      "items": [
